    "description": "Takara & Company Ltd. produces, consults, prints, and translates disclosure and IR-related materials in Japan and internationally. The company offers project proposal, design creation, proofreading, printing, electronic, and other services for statutory disclosure documents; and voluntary disclosure documents created for shareholders and investors. It is also involved in the provision of support services for general shareholders meetings; creation of examples; and provision of various information and seminars for persons in charge of disclosure, as well as for acquiring certifications. In addition, the company offers automation tools; WizLaboBudget, a budget management support tool; support services for the preparation of listing application documents required for initial public offering companies and support for audit responses; and advisory services related to the creation of ESG and integrated reports that create corporate social value, as well as develops applications and systems, corporate sites, such as ER/SR tools. Further, it provides support services for the transition to IFRS disclosure; disclosure of corrections and settlement of accounts and early settlement of accounts; advisory services, such as M&A support and listing examinations services on the TOKYO PRO Market; translation services covering a range of fields, including translation of confidential information and IR materials related to M&A; localization services; and support for customers global business development. Additionally, the company develops and sells AI translation systems, and support in setting up the translation environment. Takara & Company Ltd. was founded in 1952 and is headquartered in Tokyo, Japan."
